{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vOtPxlblCEUhnqZ6QhlTeA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:58.823802+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vOtPxlblCEUhnqZ6QhlTeA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiahvib2lcsZ9tpOltGdeVD9ZLSwtiaA8yvgEaVxHibU2ZAMpugpib7Q0BggA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>为了让学生更加深入了解中国科学院水生生物研究所在水生生物多样性与</span></span><strong><span><span>水生态环境保护、水产种质创新与未来渔业发展、藻类与生物制造研究等方向的科研情况，2025年水生所“水生生物学</span></span></strong><span><span>”夏令营拟定于7月21-25日在江城武汉开幕，将招募营员60人，此次夏令营将安排营员参观水生所科研园区，听取科研讲座，与专家、导师面对面交流等活动。</span></span><strong><span><span>水生所将从营员中选择优秀学生作为下一年度推荐免试研究生的部分生源。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>单位招生代码</span></span></strong><span><span>：80119</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>研究所网址：</span></span></strong><span><span>www.ihb.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>研究生教育网址</span></span></strong><span><span>：http://edu.ihb.cas.cn</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiaRQ7YrxaJUczicJ5brDnmJaxH5htickwrwW257UlZsHdgeZWDwCSacf9g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiaoJtSJyrAuBkVgLcaolwa6YVyTIlEm7x81w1aTlia7RILFaR7OnCbcdg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiam7iaRMMa2uicb85Qqyzz7DibFbicenNOoJrib7EUHm0s0gPibwxl5DJZwibxg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.生物、环境科学、水产养殖及相关专业</span></span><strong><span><span>2022级本科生（2026年7月毕业）</span></span></strong><span><span>；部分研究方向欢迎计算机、自动化等专业本科生；优先考虑来自中国科学院大学、中国科学技术大学、上海科技大学、“985”高校、“双一流”高校或双一流学科的同学。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2.学习成绩优秀，本科期间总评成绩排名在</span></span><strong><span><span>本专业前20%之内</span></span></strong><span><span>；对有出色的科研成果者学习成绩标准可适当放宽至40%左右。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>3.对生物、环境科学、水产养殖等专业有浓厚兴趣，并有较强的或潜在的</span></span><strong><span><span>研究能力。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>4.具备一定的</span></span><strong><span><span>外语水平和外语语言使用能力</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiaoJtSJyrAuBkVgLcaolwa6YVyTIlEm7x81w1aTlia7RILFaR7OnCbcdg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>二、申请办法及时间</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiam7iaRMMa2uicb85Qqyzz7DibFbicenNOoJrib7EUHm0s0gPibwxl5DJZwibxg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.</span></span><strong><span><span>网上报名：</span></span></strong><span><span>国科大“科教结合协同育人行动计划”网站（http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/），在“夏令营报名（学生）”进行注册、填报信息。（温馨提示：建议使用谷歌浏览器）。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><strong><span><span>报名时间：</span></span></strong><span><span>即日起——2025年6月30日。</span></span></p><p><span><span>经专家委员会筛选，于2025年7月初将拟接收的营员名单在网上公布并直接通知本人，届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiaoJtSJyrAuBkVgLcaolwa6YVyTIlEm7x81w1aTlia7RILFaR7OnCbcdg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>三、申请材料</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiam7iaRMMa2uicb85Qqyzz7DibFbicenNOoJrib7EUHm0s0gPibwxl5DJZwibxg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>自2018年起，夏令营材料只需提供电子版材料（有关材料请扫描），包含有：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.中国科学院大学2025年大学生夏令营申请表电子版；</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.截止到目前本科成绩单和专业排名证明（需加盖学院级教务处公章或所在院系公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.英语水平证明电子版（如国家英语四级、六级考试成绩或TOEFL成绩、或GRE成绩等扫描件）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.其他证明材料扫描件（如已发表论文、奖状及各类证书等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>上述材料请按照申请表、成绩单、英语水平证明、奖状复印件、各类证书、其他材料的顺序进行扫描并</span></span><strong><span><span>合成一份PDF文件</span></span></strong><span><span>（大小不要超过15M，可通过PDF调整大小功能实现）。较厚的论文及出版物只需提供首页及摘要部分即可。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>注：电子版材料请于</span></span><strong><span><span>2025年6月30日之前</span></span></strong><span><span>发送至邮箱yjs@ihb.ac.cn，文件命名为“毕业年份-高校全称-专业全称-姓名”。邮件主题为</span></span><strong><span><span>“夏令营-毕业年份-高校全称-专业全称-姓名”</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiakOehYZDb6lm1DSPTT2J7H0I2JSMiaeQlsDZRpK0V8gcSrSBemUTFzvQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/vibic0MGx4X7uiaBUjKR6ibMkbuQcZf39iaoiaoJtSJyrAuBkVgLcaolwa6YVyTIlEm7x81w1aTlia7RILFaR7OnCbcdg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>四、注意事项</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"htt